-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The original PyTorch / sentence-transformers model was modified as follows:

  * Three sub-modules were extracted from the original model: the vision
    tower, the multimodal embedder (embed_vision) and the language model.
  * Each sub-module was exported with torch.export and converted to the
    Core ML ML Program format (coremltools 9.0, FP32 compute precision,
    minimum deployment target iOS 18). For the vision tower and the language
    model, aten.__and__.Tensor graph nodes were rewritten to
    aten.logical_and.default before conversion.
  * The weights of the converted models were quantized to 4-bit integers
    (linear symmetric, per-block, block size 32) with
    coremltools.optimize.coreml.linear_quantize_weights.
  * The tokenizer, the token embedding lookup for special tokens, the image
    preprocessing, the pooling / normalization / dense classification head
    and the final sigmoid are NOT included in the converted files.

